---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/paths';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | Best OutDoor Wears"
  description="How Best OutDoor Wears uses affiliate links, and what that means for you as a reader."
  canonicalPath="/affiliate-disclosure/"
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose legal-page" style="max-width:74ch; padding-top:20px;">
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p>
        Some links on this site — particularly in our gear-buying sections — are affiliate links. If you click
        one and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission from the retailer, at no extra cost to you. The
        price you pay is the same whether you use our link or go directly to the retailer.
      </p>
      <h2>How this affects our recommendations</h2>
      <p>
        We link to specific brands and retailers because they commonly fit the layering system this site
        teaches — not based on which affiliate program pays the highest commission. Where we haven't personally
        tested a product, we describe it as a commonly recommended option, not a tested endorsement.
      </p>
      <h2>Programs we may participate in</h2>
      <p>
        REI, Columbia, YETI, GSI Outdoors, and similar outdoor retailers' affiliate or partner programs.
        Affiliate IDs are configured by the site owner and don't change the content or structure of our guides.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Reach out via our <a href={url('/contact/')}>contact page</a> if you have questions about a specific link.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
